  "icd_codes": [
    "C22.0"
  ],
  "summary": "From a suspicious liver lesion to a staged HCC (BCLC) presented at the indication committee / MDT. Ends where the treatment pathway starts. DRAFT for clinicians: requirement levels follow the binding ČOS text; order, grouping and sla_days are local placeholders.",
  "notes": [
    "HCC can be diagnosed without histology: the noninvasive_dx decision is rule-decided from imaging + liver risk facts.",
    "Out of scope (treatment planning, after the MDT): HVPG before resection in cirrhosis (ČOS 6.1, 'Resekce jater'), transplant work-up (ČOS chapter 49), TACE/ablation (chapter 37).",
    "sla_days are local placeholders, not taken from any source."
  ],
